        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "The perception of being in control motivates aggressive policymaking.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      },
      {
        "text": "Leadership decisions are influenced more by strategic timing than by long-term vision.",
        "confidence": 0.83
