    "turn_text": "From the standpoint of outsiders, I guess things like the filibuster sort of inside game. So the filibuster really is important I think to the business community to groups like ours because I think we're all better off if legislation takes time and has deliberation. Is there anything we can do or do you think this is such a high political issue that it's If it goes one way or the other, the outside can't affect it. It's just the internal politics that rule the Senate that will determine what happens.",
